      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: That really is the biggest issue in general for a lot of VRChat world concepts I can think of, lack of any kind of persistence. If it was possible for us to save data locally/server-side, persistent worlds could be made such as ones including economies, inventories, unlocks, etc. :p",
