  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is something I’m surprised VR Chat doesn’t have. Why not let us build our private/public homes from inside the game itself? It could be like that steam game VR Home. Only with more options. What you could do is offer a selection of home templates, all blank of course, or the user could make their own custom home. Setting up walls and ceilings. And you could also offer a selection of furniture to decorate their homes. Putting together their own personal castle of sorts. It’d be like… Minecraft + Second life, in VR. Heck, for the custom home making, it could be something like a VR version of the mobile game Home Design 3D.\n\nEdit: we could even take this a step further. Allow the option to invite friends and build the home together.",
